NEARS-1206 — CurrentModule middleware trust-boundary demonstration (live, port 8124)
Authenticated admin session (jar2, admin@admin.com).

1. GET /admin?module_id=1               -> session('current_module') = '1'
2. GET /admin?module_id=999999 (invalid) -> session('current_module') STAYS '1'
                                             (crafted id did NOT poison scope)
3. GET /admin?module_id=2 (valid)        -> session('current_module') = '2'

Each value read directly from storage/framework/sessions/<latest session file>
via `unserialize()` immediately after each request. Backend log clean
(no new [FAIL]/[ERR] lines).
